      "message": "\u003e I checked taht the implementations of AvbOps in u-boot or fs_mgr do not have null check for these methods either\n\nSure, but here (in Rust) checking for non-NULL isn\u0027t only \"good practice\", it\u0027s actually mandated by the language\u0027s standard library through `unsafe`; please either address why the pointer can be used as-is in the `SAFETY` comment (it can\u0027t) or validate it yourself.",
