      "writtenOn": "2022-12-22T15:10:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why not use `ptr::write`? It\u0027s supposed to be used for such cases and it has both alignment and null checks[1].\n\n[1] https://doc.rust-lang.org/src/core/ptr/mod.rs.html#1320",
