      "message": "I think this is dangerous as the borrow checker loses track of the slices, AFAICT.\n\nInstead, can\u0027t `Payload` have an explicit lifetime and track the slices directly? This would remove the need for `.kernel()` and `.trusted_public_key()` and reduce the number of members.",
