      "message": "As you\u0027re defining `Payload` here, can\u0027t you implement this as `impl AsRef\u003cPayload\u003e for AvbOps` and use\n```\nlet ops \u003d \u0026 *ops;\nlet payload \u003d ops.as_ref();\n```\nat the call site, making it clear that this is re-interpreting by reference and not by value?",
