      "writtenOn": "2022-12-22T15:10:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Mmm, I don\u0027t think `AvbOps` should be assimilated to `Payload` tbh. That can be convenient for the current code but it creates lots of confusion when reading it, like why a set of operations (`AvbOps`) gets converted to a data bundle (`Payload`)... It\u0027s also not so extendable in case we want to look at other parts of `AvbOps`.",
