      "message": "Then this change cannot be merged before those changes. I thought we agreed that I develop this part on top of the normal libc and merge it like this. In the end we just switch pvmfw to call this method.\n\nThere are several advantages of landing this cl separately:\n- This enables the payload verification on the current kernel in CI. It ensures that libpvmfw_avb works with standard libc + up-to-date kernel. Anyone who modifies the kernel signature format also need to consider the verification here.\n- Once the stack of libc CLs is ready, we can just push a simple change to switch pvmfw to call this method, in case that doesn\u0027t work, we know that the problem is not from the pvmfw libc implementation.",
