      "writtenOn": "2023-01-03T17:48:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because it\u0027s then statically allocated in `.rodata` instead of being allocated and populated on the heap at runtime, which is more predictable (note the error handling you need to do?), performant, and robust (RO permissions), at the cost of a slightly more verbose syntax (which, I agree, is more verbose than necessary and hopefully will one day be addressed by the currently-nightly \"`c\"text\"`\" syntax).",
